\dEh? What did you just say?\d%K%P
「诶？什么？」%K%P
My loud internal voice drowned out her faint whisper.%K%P
我的内心呢喃着，\n使我没有听到美都子的低语…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
%XS10\dI see... so size is the issue...\d %XE%K%P
「是吗…这是个很大的底线啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dE-Excuse me?\d%K%P
「哈、哈啊？」%K%P
But when I tried to focus and listen to what she was\nsaying, I had trouble making sense of it.%K%P
这次我专心地听了她的话，\n却无法理解其中的真意。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd studying from early in the morning till late at night\nis exactly the right way to live my life, too.\d%K%P
「每天从早到晚地拼命学习，\n这也是我，如今的正途」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWell, that's true, but...\d%K%P
「那个…或许是这样吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dDon't worry. Everything's going great. I'll most likely\nbe a first year at Shuusen Preparatory come next spring.\d%K%P
「没关系，一切都会好起来的。\n春天一到，我肯定就是秋泉大附属的一年生了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou don't think you're... pushing yourself a little too\nhard?\d%K%P
「一个人…没有逞强吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNot at all.\d%K%P
「没啦」%K%P
That was a stupid question.%K%P
这种问题，\n对她来说简直是愚蠢透顶。%K%P
If she wasn't pushing herself too hard, then who in her\nage group was?%K%P
美都子做了这么多，和她同年代的孩子若是毫不逞强，\n恐怕谁都会受不了吧。%K%P
She took care of all the household chores by herself, ran\na boarding house, and even looked after some of the more\nhelpless adults when they needed her help.%K%P
一个人，包办家务，担任房东，\n还照顾着身边无所事事的大人们。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHow long do you stay up these days?\d%K%P
「最近…几点钟起床啊？」%K%P
And on top of that, she spent all her extra time studying.\nIf that didn't put an unreasonable strain on her...%K%P
而且，从早到晚，认真地努力着，\n即便如此，她也只是付之一笑…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHmm, I think I go to sleep around twelve. I think I got\nin the habit of staying up a little too late these days.\d%K%P
「嗯～，１２点钟左右吧？\n到底还是熬到深夜了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...That's not true, is it?\d%K%P
「…不对吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
...then she wouldn't feel the need to lie here, either.%K%P
这种谎话…她怎么可能撒得出来呢。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYour lights were still on around 3AM on Friday. And they\nwere still on past 4AM on Saturday as well.\d%K%P
「星期五的夜里，直到３点钟灯还亮着。\n星期六的夜里，过了４点钟灯还亮着」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「哎…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou're lying about not pushing yourself, aren't you? In\nfact, you probably have it rougher than when you were\ndelivering newspapers.\d%K%P
「没有逞强，你是在说谎吧？\n如今的美都子，比起送报纸的那时候…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, that... I just felt like being a night owl on\nweekends. In exchange, I've been sleeping until noon these\ndays, so...\d%K%P
「啊、啊～，周末我就变成夜猫子了。\n因为周六白天睡了好久…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI saw you raking leaves in the garden at 7AM the next\nday. And then you cleaned the whole house and went\nshopping.\d%K%P
「早上７点不还是在打扫庭院吗。\n在那之后，打扫公寓，又出门去购物」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
%XS10\dWhy the hell do you keep tabs on me? You could use that time to be\nwith Himeo instead.\d %XE%K%P
「为什么要那么盯着我啊…\n你一直陪着姬绪姐不好吗」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYour lights were on until around 4AM yesterday, too. But\nnow you are here, right in front of me at this hour.\n...You're not sleeping, are you?\d%K%P
「昨夜也是，直到４点钟时灯还没熄灭。\n可是美都子如今却出现在这里。\n…你只是没有睡觉对吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dLook, I do sleep... for two hours or so.\d%K%P
「睡过了啊…两小时」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNot getting enough sleep is bad for your health. Um...\nwhat exactly do you hope to achieve by pushing yourself\nthis hard with such random timing?\d%K%P
「不好好休息，可是对身体不好啊。\n哎…你这么逞强，该怎么办呢」%K%P
It took me a few seconds to figure out what to say next. I\nknew that pointing out how she was still in her growing\nphase would only elicit her anger.%K%P
说『你正在发育期』这种话，会让她发怒吧，\n所以我想了想，收回了后半句话。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's impossible to do everything by yourself. You should\ntrust me and Himeo a bit more.\d%K%P
「什么都你一个人来做果然还是太勉强了。\n偶尔依靠一下我和姬绪小姐也…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo. I don't need your help. Either of you would just be\nin the way.\d%K%P
「不要。不用。完全没有必要」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI don't think that's a very nice thing to say. It might\nbe true in my case, but Himeo would be hurt if she heard\nthat.\d%K%P
「没有这种说法吧…\n我暂且不说，姬绪小姐太可怜了啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
%XS10\dAh, just leave me alone already...\d %XE%K%P
「你好烦人啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko...\d%K%P
「美都子…」%K%P
I couldn't make out most of her mumbling, but I could\nstill see her facial expressions just fine.%K%P
虽然我听不到她偶尔的叹息，\n即便如此，她疲倦而寂寞的神情，却在我的脑海中挥之不去。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNo way. I know you two would be pushing yourselves too\nhard for me. And I have historical facts to back me up.\d%K%P
「不行。\n我知道，你们两人为了我，已经很勉强了。\n不管怎么说，过去的事也证明了这一点」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNeither Himeo nor I have ever felt that way.\d%K%P
「我也好，姬绪小姐也好，\n可从没有过为了你而勉强过啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWell, in that case, I don't think I've ever pushed myself\ntoo hard either. Not for myself or anyone else, okay?\d%K%P
「既然如此，我也是，\n从来没有为自己而勉强过」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
She had a retort ready for anything I'd say.%K%P
我那么说，她就这么说…%K%P
Her answers came so fast I couldn't help wondering if she\nhad prepared them ahead of time, carefully picking the\nmost effective words in order to shoo me away.%K%P
仿佛就像模拟考试一般，\n一句一句中规中矩地回复，有问必答，\n反应快到都让我怀疑她早已有了准备。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm, Mitoko.\d%K%P
「呐，美都子」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Hm?\d%K%P
「…嗯？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDid I... hurt you somehow?\d%K%P
「我…有没有伤害到你啊？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Oh, don't be silly.\d%K%P
「…怎么可能」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI mean... normally, you'd just snap at me. If I did\nsomething wrong, you would always scold me, wouldn't you?\d%K%P
「因为…以前你总是对我发怒啊。\n我要是摆出一副消极无奈的态度，你不就会马上呵斥我吗」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat's that supposed to mean? I have no idea what you're\neven trying to say. C'mon, stop messing with my knowledge\nof Japanese.\d%K%P
「什么啊。我不明白你说的什么。\n真是的，不要拉低我的语文水平啊」%K%P
Usually, Mitoko would shout at me while I fervently\napologized.%K%P
是的…\n过去的美都子，总是呵斥着我。\n而我总是向她低头谢罪。%K%P
She was very forceful with how she tried to involve\nherself in my life, and how she tried to put a distance\nbetween us. Our relationship might've been all over the\nplace, but one thing it didn't lack was raw emotion.%K%P
在积极意义上，她和我若即若离。\n在积极插手与漠不关心之间往往复复。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI was pretty desperate at the time and might not have\nrealized it, but... was there something I said that may\nhave hurt you?\d%K%P
「那时我没有拼命认真去察觉，\n莫非，我对你说了很过分的话么」%K%P
Himeo kept saying how I hurt her all the time --\nespecially in bed -- but putting that aside...%K%P
如今用『过分』来指责我的，\n似乎成了姬绪小姐的特权，那个暂且不谈…%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm not sure what occasion you're referring to, and I\nalso don't recall you hurting me in any way whatsoever.\d%K%P
「我又不知道你说的那个时候具体是哪一天，\n完全没有头绪嘛」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI meant the first Sunday of last month. The night you\ncalled me when I was at our company's party.\d%K%P
「上个月的第一个星期天…\n公司聚会的那天，打的那个电话…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
%XS10\dWhy do you keep pressing me about this...? Can't you take a goddamn\nhint?\d %XE%K%P
「为什么非要聊这个啊。\n真是的，好好注意一下气氛…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI believe I might've just taken the sister you loved so\nmuch and... I... well...\d%K%P
「我把你一直最喜欢的姐姐…\n姫绪小姐、给、那个…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt was all for the best.\d%K%P
「挺好的啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIs that what you really think?\d%K%P
「你真的，这么想吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'd known about Himeo's feelings way before you. In fact,\nI was pretty fidgety waiting for you to actually take\nnotice yourself.\d%K%P
「我，很早以前就明白姬绪姐的心思了。\n理先生一直没注意到，都让她焦急万分了哦？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIs that... so...\d%K%P
「是…吗」%K%P
Instead of her usual anger, Mitoko would now simply face\nme with this vague, indiscernible smile of hers. I\ncouldn't remember the last time she actually started a\nconversation with me.%K%P
如今的美都子没有生气。脸上泛着淡淡的微笑。\n可是，我却笑不出来。%K%P
I wasn't sure if she was faking this complete apathy\ntowards everything involving me, but she certainly kept a\ndistance between us. Almost like I was a stranger.%K%P
是强颜欢笑，还是发自真心暂且不谈，那个无所谓。\n唯一确定的是，我们的内心相隔甚远。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dCongratulations to the both of you. I hope you'll have a\nhappy life together.\d%K%P
「二位真是可喜可贺。\n你们要一直幸福下去啊」%K%P
She talked about the event that changed our lives as\nthough it was no big deal.%K%P
对我们来说，如此重大的事件，\n却用这种陈词滥调的方式，才得以陈述。%K%P
It seemed unnatural how easily she got over it.%K%P
不自然到与日常之事都可以简单等同了。%K%P
As such...%K%P
所以…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dUm... Thank you. Even on that night, you were a big help\nto me.\d%K%P
「那个…谢谢你了。\n那时也鼓励了我」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYep.\d%K%P
「嗯」%K%P
As such, I could not pry any further.%K%P
所以，我不能再进一步了。%K%P
Right now, she was completely different from the girl who\ntackled me on that rainy night, laughing and apologizing\nwith the innocence of a child.%K%P
如今的美都子，\n和狠狠地扇我耳光…\n事后又满不在乎地和我道歉时的那个她，有着天壤之别。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dStill, I can't exactly condone staying up so late. By the\ntime you realize you're sick, it's going to be too late.\d%K%P
「我说，你也别熬到那么晚了啊。\n伤害了身体，生病时可就没有后悔药了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhaha, I know that much. I just let it get to my head a\nbit last week. I'll be more careful from now on.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈，我知道我知道啦。\n只有上周才那样嘛。\n从今天开始我注意还不行么」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI will have Mr. Kumazaki and Yasunaga check on you from\ntime to time -- they tend to stay up drinking until the\nearly hours.\d%K%P
「今后，我会让熊崎先生和八须永君时常去察看你的啊？\n他们总是通宵饮酒直到天亮」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou don't trust me at all, huh.\d%K%P
「信不过我啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou're the last person I can trust when it comes to not\noverexerting yourself, especially when there's no one to\nwatch you.\d%K%P
「关于努力方面的命令，\n我可无法轻易信任你啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhaha, that's pretty weird when you think about it.\d%K%P
「啊哈哈，真奇怪～」%K%P
In the end, I couldn't get anything out of her. I had\nsuffered a thorough defeat, as usual.%K%P
结果，我也没有再进一步。\n这次，我又败下了阵来。%K%P
This didn't feel good. I didn't feel happy at all. Neither\nof us could genuinely cheer each other on.%K%P
闷闷不乐，郁闷非常，\n在两个人的斗争中，我完全败下了阵来。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnyway, I'll be off.\d%K%P
「那我走了」%K%P
And it seemed like luck had decided to abandon me for\nbeing the indecisive fool I was -- we reached our fork in\nthe road.%K%P
犹豫不决的我，运气似乎也消耗殆尽了，\n不意间，我和美都子走到了离别的分岔路上。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTake care.\d%K%P
「一路走好」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d.........See you.\d%K%P
「………我走了」%K%P
She seemed hesitant at first, almost like she didn't want\nto exchange these words with me, but ultimately replied\nwith a low mumble to give the impression of caring.%K%P
仿佛不愿与我打招呼一般，\n最后，她勉强地对我嘟囔了一句。%K%P
When and how did it come to this...?%K%P
从何时开始，变成这样了呢…%K%P
It couldn't be just that Sunday. There had been plenty\nother signs from even earlier.%K%P
只是那个星期日的事，是不应该变成这样的。\n在那之前，征兆就已经显露了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d\dI'll go ahead!\d\d%K%P
『我先走了！』%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d\dI'll still go ahead, okay?! See you! I'm off!\d\d%K%P
『即使如此，我也先走了！\n回见！我出发了！』%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
Did it all start... back then?%K%P
莫非，是从这个地方，开始…？%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「…哎」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, I hate this... I hate Mondays...\d%K%P
「啊啊，真烦人啊…\n星期一提不起劲」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI so don't want to go to school right now...\d%K%P
「学校…不想去」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut it's just like me to go anyway, huh.\d%K%P
「即便如此也要上学去吧，\n真是没办法呢」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
