%LC西装男
\dExcuse me. Would I be correct in assuming that you are\nMs. Hinosaka? Hinosaka Mitoko?\d%K%P
「抱歉。\n您是阳坂小姐吧？\n阳坂美都子小姐？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
