%LC木下
\dMr. Yoshimura. You've got a phone call.\d%K%P
「芳村先生。这里有您的电话」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, thank you.\d%K%P
「啊，好的」%K%P
%LCKinoshita
%LC木下
\dUm... it's from someone called Kouno. A woman.\d%K%P
「那个…是一个叫香野的女性打来的…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWh-What?!\d%K%P
「什…什么！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo! I mean, Ms. Sawashima! You're overreacting!\nAnyway, um, can you transfer it to me?\d%K%P
「姫绪小姐，不，泽嶋小姐反应过度了！\n那个，转接过来吧」%K%P
Though it wasn't really the \dwoman\d part -- which Ms.\nKinoshita cunningly took care to emphasize -- that\ntriggered her.%K%P
不过，让她起反应的，\n并不是木下小姐所强调的『女性』这个词…%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dH-Hey... We're in the middle of work! You can't be having\nprivate phone calls here...\d%K%P
「喂、喂…现在是工作中吧？\n那种私人电话，现在是不能随便打的吧…？」%K%P
Well, not like that made things any better.%K%P
不，哎…虽说如此，\n但什么问题都没解决这一点倒是千真万确。%K%P
%LCKinoshita
%LC木下
\d...Here you go.\d%K%P
「…转接过去了啊」%K%P
