木下小姐一边笑着，一边把电话接到了我这边的内线上。%K%P
Phew, it didn't seem like she realized how much of a big\nfish she was letting pass as far as office gossip was\nconcerned.%K%P
太好了…\n这样她就不会在意打来电话的是谁了。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
