「………抱歉，\n请您稍等一下」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMs. Sawashima... Ms. Managing Director!\d%K%P
「泽嶋小姐…\n董事！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dEek?! Y-Yes...?\d%K%P
「呀啊！？\n嗯、嗯嗯…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPlease return to your seat.\d%K%P
「请回到座位上去」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dEh? Ah...\d%K%P
