%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMs. Kaya...?\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐…」%K%P
...and a man in a grey suit with a little girl in a\nuniform standing next to him.%K%P
以及，穿灰色西装的男人，\n和穿着制服的小个子女孩…%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...Eh?\d%K%P
「………诶？」%K%P
And after we all jumped to the wrong conclusion due to\nmisunderstanding, Mitoko's so-called kidnapping case came\nto a peaceful conclusion.%K%P
就这样…\n美都子疑似诱拐事件，\n在大家的虚惊一场之下，有惊无险地解决了。%K%P
But the fact I felt relief only proved how much I was\nunderestimating the severity of the situation at the time.%K%P
…我放心地摸了摸心口，\n看来都到此时了，我还是对这次的事态不以为然啊…%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCOsamu & Himeo & Asami
%LC理＆姫绪＆麻实
\dEeeeeeeh?!\d%K%P
「诶诶诶诶诶诶诶诶！？」%K%P
I had no time to embrace her, nor to celebrate her safe\nreturn. I couldn't even scold her for skipping school.%K%P
因平安而欣喜的拥抱，\n因翘课而不住的说教…%K%P
All the plans I had for Mitoko when she came back...%K%P
美都子刚一回来，\n我们想到的这之后的计划…%K%P
...were instantly swept away by the man that returned with\nher.%K%P
因为和她在一起回来的这个男人，\n结果这一切全都告吹了。%K%P
%LCMan in a Suit
%LC西装男
\dThis is neither a lie nor a mistake, and certainly not an\nattempt at fraud. As you can see, this paper is signed by\nthe registered seal of the Hinosakas. ...It is very much a\nbinding legal agreement.\d%K%P
「没有说谎，没有搞错，更不是欺诈。\n毫无疑问，这是阳坂家的印章。\n…这份文件，具有法律效力」%K%P
