「为什么事到如今了还…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
In contrast to Mitoko's room, which fell completely\nsilent...%K%P
与美都子房间里尴尬的沉默相对的…%K%P
