\dEeeeeeeh?!\d%K%P
「诶诶诶诶诶诶诶诶！？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSeriously! I won't try to stop you from eavesdropping,\nbut at least have the good will to not interfere with our\nconversation!\d%K%P
「喂喂！\n不要偷听了，至少安静一下吧！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dM-My apologies...\d%K%P
「不、不好意思打扰您了…」%K%P
%LCMan in a Suit
%LC西装男
\dPlease do not concern yourself with it. I can hardly\nblame the tenants of this establishment for being so\nsurprised. Ah, my apologies for the late introduction. My\nname is Nishikawa from Jousai Building.\d%K%P
「不，居民会对此这么吃惊，也是情理之中…\n啊，刚刚忘了说，我，是城西建物的西川」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh, I owe you an apology as well. I am Yoshimura from\nMichihama Commerce. It is a pleasure to meet you.\d%K%P
「啊，非常感谢您特地造访这里。\n我是道浜商事的芳村。\n一直以来承蒙您多多照顾…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dOsamu... Seriously, what's the point of handing him your\ncard?\d%K%P
「喂，理…\n你没必要把名片拿出来吧？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI-I don't think you have the right to order him around!\nHe works for me!\d%K%P
「不、不需要听你的意见！\n理先生可是我的部下！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou still haven't given up on playing executive?\d%K%P
「你，还在没完没了吗？小鬼董事」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dPlaying?! What is that supposed to mean?! I'll have you\nknow that I'm the person fated to run the Sawashima Group\nin the future, okay?! ...Well, unless I end up finding a\nvery capable husband.\d%K%P
「小鬼是什么称呼啊！\n我可是迟早会成为泽嶋集团的骨干的啊？\n…嘛，若是有个优秀的伴侣，就是前途无量的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm sorry, but could you two please stop quarreling over\nmatters that are not related to the current situation?\d%K%P
「抱歉，请不要在和正事无关的地方进行无聊的争吵了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
And I had just warned the people next door for bothering\nus.%K%P
刚刚注意力完全集中到门那边的聒噪上去了…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAre you the president of Jousai Building, Mr. Nishikawa?\d%K%P
「西川…社长，是吧？」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dYes, well... it is a very small company.\d%K%P
「嗯，嘛，是家小公司」%K%P
The card I had been given referred to him as \dJousai\nBuilding Ltd. Managing Director Nishikawa Shingo\d.%K%P
递过来的名片上，\n写着『城西建物有限公司　董事长　西川晋吾』。%K%P
He worked in real estate, the same field as us. If his\ncar's registration plate was to be believed, he was from\nYokohama.%K%P
房地产交易公司…也就是我的同行。\n住所和车牌号，都在神奈川县横滨市。%K%P
He seemed to be in his forties at most; the company he\nmanaged must've been fairly small-scale.%K%P
我眼前是一位４０岁上下的男性社长，\n可他的公司规模还不大，想来还是一家年轻的企业。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dS-So how did this bond get into your hands?\d%K%P
「那、那个…\n这份借据的由来是…？」%K%P
Yet instead of contemplating the business card, all eyes\nin the room were fixed on a certain other paper.%K%P
可是现在，在场所有人的视线，\n没有看向他的名片，而是都集中到了他手中的那份Ａ４纸张上。%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dUm... I bought it from someone else, you see.\d%K%P
「那个…实际上，这也是别人转交给我的」%K%P
A short, barely one-page long bond...%K%P
那是一纸凭据。%K%P
...with an almost painfully simple deal described on it.%K%P
文面居于其上，\n白纸黑字，记述着相应的内容。%K%P
If one were to pick out only the important keywords, they\nwould end up with...%K%P
所以，只看那些具有特征的关键字，\n那张纸上的内容，就能一目了然。%K%P
\dKagoshima Junitarou.\d%K%P
『神子岛顺一郎先生』%K%P
\dOne million yen.\d%K%P
『１００万日元』%K%P
\dLoan.\d%K%P
『证明已借用』%K%P
\dIn case of failure to repay\d%K%P
『如若不能归还』%K%P
\dAll land and housing at East Hagimori 3-24\d%K%P
『东萩守三丁目２４番地的土地、家宅』%K%P
\dMortgage and appropriation.\d%K%P
『提供担保』%K%P
\dSeptember 1, 19XX.\d%K%P
『１９××年　９月１日』%K%P
\dHinosaka Honoka.\d%K%P
『阳坂穗香』%K%P
Basically, what everyone on the other side of the door was\nsaying.%K%P
简要地说…\n就是刚刚大家在门外所言的内容。%K%P
After being completely forgotten for a decade, a debt that\nMs. Honoka had accumulated with one of her acquaintances\ncame back to haunt us.%K%P
穗香小姐在几十年以前，\n和某位熟人借钱的借据，\n如今重见了天日…%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dI hear this Mr. Kagoshima has been living just next to\nyou.\d%K%P
「这位神子岛先生…\n以前好像就居住在这附近」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDo you know him, Mitoko?\d%K%P
「美都子，你听说过这个人吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dShake shake.\d%K%P
「…（摇了摇头）」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI see...\d%K%P
「是吗…」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dTo tell the truth, he passed away just the other day, and\nhis son -- who had inherited his assets -- found this\namong his old possessions.\d%K%P
「实际上，他上个月刚刚去世了。\n继承遗产的儿子，在他的保险箱里，\n偶然发现了这个」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo he passed away...\d%K%P
「已经去世了么…」%K%P
That meant we couldn't even confirm the legitimacy of this\ndocument with the person directly responsible for it.%K%P
既然这样，那订下契约的二人，\n已经不可能再亲自确认事实了。%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dThe son did not know what to do with a personal bond like\nthat, and after consulting a tax counselor, he was re-\ndirected to me.\d%K%P
「他的儿子，考虑到这是一张个人的借据，\n处理起来可能有些困难…所以找到了认识的税务师，\n和我来商谈此事」%K%P
The signature on this paper belonged to Hinosaka Honoka\nwithout a shadow of a doubt. I knew, because I'd seen it\nquite a few times in the past.%K%P
可能确定的是，这份借据上的印章，\n与阳坂家的印章别无二致。\n我见过很多次，不可能认错。%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dAs for me... I'd been planning to invest in an apartment\ncomplex around this area, and so, you could say this turn\nof events felt like an act of divine guidance.\d%K%P
「话说回来，我们正好是\n要到这里考察这边建筑的开发计划，\n没想到会碰到这等方便事…」%K%P
I could certainly imagine Ms. Honoka racking up a number\nof old debts.%K%P
而且，签下这份借据的若是穗香小姐，\n大概也会若无其事地说出『啊啊，大概是这样』吧…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo... you bought the bond from him?\d%K%P
「那…这份借据的所有者是谁？\n是他的儿子吗？」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dThat is correct. It was worth a million yen a decade ago,\nwhich meant I also had to compensate for the inflation.\d%K%P
「嗯，十几年前的１００万日元，\n再算上利息…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dB-But this land is worth way more than...\d%K%P
「可、可是…这片土地…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI've heard enough!\d%K%P
「给我适可而止吧！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNn?!\d%K%P
「啊？」%K%P
The person who interrupted my meek attempt at a counter-\nargument was not the frail, miserable girl who had\ninherited a large debt from god knows when.%K%P
抢在如履薄冰地进行反驳的我之前的，\n并不是对过去的大笔借款一无所知，现在却要母债女还的，\n那位不幸的少女。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dYou'd stoop this low just to get your hands on some\nquality land on the cheap?! Have you no shame as a\nprofessional?\d%K%P
「这么好的地段，居然只用１００万就想得到吗！\n房地产商居然这么不知廉耻！？」%K%P
Raised by a real estate magnate and potentially on the\nroad to become one herself (though I doubted it), she was\nboth studious and had pride as an amateur.%K%P
而是出生在日本赫赫有名的地产实业者之家，\n自己将来也可能从事这一行业的\n地产经理人。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dH-Himeo... Calm down!\d%K%P
「姬、姫绪小姐…冷静一下」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThat's right. This person has told us everything in a\ncalm and civil manner. Things will only get worse if we\nstart getting emotional here.\d%K%P
「对啊，这事也要冷静来谈，\n我们发怒也只会造成不利」%K%P
I felt that buying up valuable land at cheap prices was\nexactly what a professional in this business was supposed\nto be doing, but I decided to keep that thought to myself\nfor the time being.%K%P
以低价收购高价的土地，\n这还真是够专业的啊，\n嘛，这个话题果然还是先放在一边吧。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dB-But! But! This is ridiculous...!\d%K%P
「可、可是、可是！\n这么荒唐的条件，简直不能答应…」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dAh, I suppose it does indeed look like quite a severe\nmortgage condition. I imagine they were not overly serious\nabout this.\d%K%P
「啊～，作为担保人，他也的确是很不称职。\n恐怕他本来只是想做口头协定的吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...? What do you mean?\d%K%P
「诶…您这是什么意思？」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dFrom what I hear, this Mr. Kamikojima was a wealthy but\nvery kind man who often forgot about most of the money he\nlent to others.\d%K%P
「呀啊，这位神子岛老先生，\n非常有钱，是个老好人…\n借了别人的钱，经常是说完就给忘了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-Is that so...?\d%K%P
「是、是这样吗…？」%K%P
That sounded like a very nice friend to have. I sincerely\nhoped he didn't get too many e-mails from Nigerian\nprinces, though...%K%P
真是让人羡慕啊…不管怎么想都是。\n电话诈骗集团没找上他，真是万幸…%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dAnd so, he would normally never even form a bond when he\nlent money, but...\d%K%P
「他一般在借别人钱的时候，\n好像都没有借据…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCould that actually have been Ms. Honoka's idea...?\d%K%P
「莫非是…穗香小姐主动…？」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dThat seems likely. I imagine she was sure she would be\nable to return the debt.\d%K%P
「嘛…大概是这样吧。\n她是打算一定要还钱的吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI see...\d%K%P
「原来如此…」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dBut Mr. Kamikojima moved away, and with it, her chance\nwas lost. Eventually, they probably both forgot all about\nit.\d%K%P
「话说回来，神子岛先生后来搬了家，\n因为失去了还钱的机会，\n那两人好像都忘记了这一回事啊」%K%P
A wealthy and benevolent neighbor who did not even bother\npreparing an official document for lending millions of\nyen.%K%P
砰地借出了１００万，\n而且连借据都不用写的好人邻居。%K%P
And the emotional woman who nonetheless wanted to prove\nher sincerity by pledging her most valuable possession\nover it.%K%P
相应的，把自己价值最高的财产拿来担保，\n以表示诚意，情深意重的夫人。%K%P
If those two were here, they would probably laugh it off\nas a story from ages ago.%K%P
这两个人之间一定会边说道\n『啊啊，是有这么一回事儿啊』，\n边微笑着将这事不了了之。%K%P
But now we only had an old, legally binding paper.%K%P
可是如今，借据仍在，当事人却无影无踪。%K%P
As such, the people left behind -- ourselves -- had no\nother option but to fight over the legitimacy of this\nclaim.%K%P
所以，留下的人们能做的，\n只有赌一赌这份文件，到底还有没有法律效力。%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dStill, I cannot help but sympathize with the young lady\nhere. I am certainly not shameless enough to try and buy\nout this land for something as ridiculous as a few\nthousand yen per square meter.\d%K%P
「哎，虽然这么说，但正如那位小姐所言，\n以每坪１万元以下的价格收购这片土地，\n这么苛刻的要求，也太强人所难了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dTh-Then what are you...\d%K%P
「那、那也就是说，这片土地…？」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dI would be more than happy to pay in accordance with the\ntotal value of this land... minus five million yen. Would\nyou be willing to part with it for a sum of that caliber?\d%K%P
「现在土地的估值，大概是不到５００万吧。\n这样就可以把这片土地转出来了吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dAnd that is not all. I would like to extend an invitation\nto all the current tenants of this house to move into the\napartment complex on a priority basis once the\nconstruction is completed.\d%K%P
「还不仅仅是如此。\n现在居住于此的诸位，\n等待新公寓建成后，可以优先入住这里」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dW-Wait a second. I think it's a bit too early to get into\nthe specifics...\d%K%P
「等、请您先等一下。\n在什么还没有定下来的阶段，现在就谈这种具体的，这也…」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
%LC西川
\dOn top of that, I will arrange temporary lodgings for\neveryone while the construction is in process; there would\nbe no need for any deposits, and I can guarantee not to\ncharge rent for at least three years.\d%K%P
「而且，施工时各位的临时住所也已经准备好了。\n入住后，三年之内的房租全免。押金和礼金都不要」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI'm in!\d%K%P
「赚了！」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dHold up, Hachi... This sounds way too good to be true...\d%K%P
「不，先别着急…\n这也太诱人了…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSounds like a trap to me, no matter how I look at it.\d%K%P
「怎么想，这都是圈套吧？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dBut why would he go through all that trouble just to\ntrick us? It's not like any of us have the money to take\nthis to court.\d%K%P
「可是，坑了我们又有什么好处呢？\n申诉起来，我们也可以夺回自己的财产」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHey, I told you to keep it down!\d%K%P
「你们都别唧唧歪歪了！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dM-My apologies... Anyway, back to the subject at hand...\d%K%P
「抱、抱歉…\n那个啊，我说…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWe can't possibly sell this land!\d%K%P
「这片土地，怎么可能卖出去！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo... I'm begging you to calm down...\d%K%P
「姫绪小姐，你冷静一下…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThis is where Toko was born! This is where she waited for\nMs. Honoka all this time! She'd never sell this place, no\nmatter how much they offered!\d%K%P
「这里是小都子出生的地方吧？\n她一直在这里等待着穗香小姐吧？\n无论发生了什么，她都不会放弃的！」%K%P
%LCNishikawa
