%LC姫绪
\dToko...\d%K%P
「小都子…」%K%P
Mitoko was the kind of girl who could never even entertain\nthe idea of not paying her debts.%K%P
美都子本来就没有『借得之物不还』，\n这种不道德的习惯。%K%P
Not to mention... to her, this debt was personal. A\nreminder of the bond she shared with her mother.%K%P
而且，还有穗香小姐的陈年旧事，\n让她想起了藕断丝连的母女之情。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI gotta pay it back... no matter what.\d%K%P
