「哎…」%K%P
Himeo gritted her teeth as she leaned her head against my\nshoulder, wiping her tears of frustration against my\nshirt.%K%P
姫绪小姐悔恨地咬牙切齿，\n趴在我的肩膀上，拭去了流出的几滴泪水。%K%P
Her emotional outburst served only to soothe my turbulent\nheart, prompting me to start caressing her hair.%K%P
那么纯粹的感情爆发出来，\n如今显得有些楚楚可怜，\n我的另一只手抚摸着她的秀发，轻轻地安慰着她。%K%P
