Running away with a man... leaving behind debts... she did\nthe worst thing a mother could to a child.%K%P
和男人私奔逃避。留下的借款。\n对于孩子来说，真是作孽的母亲。%K%P
Still, at the same time, she did everything she could to\nraise and protect her. It was the strength of her\nemotions, not any sort of ill intent that brought this\nabout.%K%P
但是这位最坏的母亲，却一直为了孩子而苦苦支撑。\n只是，这般不合常理的人，用情却极深。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo let's try and do something about this.\nLet's try and look for the best solution together.\d%K%P
