%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOsamu...\d%K%P
「理君…」%K%P
It didn't matter if everyone else lost faith in her. As\nlong as her child found it in herself to believe in her,\ntheir family bond would remain untarnished.%K%P
不相信其他人也罢。\n只要能相信孩子的话，那就是亲子的真实含义了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWith these mortgage deals, you don't need to give up on\nyour land as long as you have some money. So let's first\nthink about how we could pay that debt back.\d%K%P
