Yet the regret and guilt washing over my heart was soon\novershadowed by sheer frustration at how readily she gave\nup.%K%P
后悔与反省焦灼着我的内心，\n可面对美都子这般缴械投降的态度，我再也无法忍耐，开始对她斥责起来。%K%P
Her mother vanished and she was all alone, with no adult\nto help her protect this place.%K%P
穗香小姐不在了，\n没有了监护人的美都子，\n就连继续生活在这里，也变得岌岌可危。%K%P
Nonetheless, she stubbornly held her ground, vowing to\nwait for her regardless of how long it would take.%K%P
即便如此，还是把周围的成年人们卷进来，\n顽强地、顽强地…\n一直守护着这里，直到母亲归来…%K%P
